From 33bd9954f2fb37113412d4c06766c13cb960ef74 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus V2 Builder <builder@lotus.org>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:58:06 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] net: tune outbound inv broadcast queue and incoming inv
 suppression window

Tune inbound/outbound inv broadcast cadence (500ms/250ms), raise
MAX_INV_BROADCAST_INTERVAL to 7, suppress redundant outbound invs when the
peer already announced the transaction, and add the
outbound_inv_queue_suppression_window unit test.
---
